src/oap_description/urdf/openarm_bimanual.urdf

The arm and body parts are derived from the OpenArm v1.0 description
(kinematics, limits, inertials), flattened from xacro, with a hand frame on
each arm's last link. Its arm and body meshes are not copied here: the URDF
refers to package://openarm_description/..., which the image builds from
upstream.
